Z||000000||Rodney||02-01-2000||06:20 PM||||I have been watching this forum for some time now but have never taken the time to register so I could post something. I have good reason to post lately. I have finally recieved the rebuild parts for the 84-86 Fiero headlight assemblies. The gears, internal bumpers and the brush/contact assemblies. <P>These are OEM not aftermarket. New-recient stock, not old stock. <P>Prices:<P>Gear  $20.00 each  $1.50 S&H<BR>Bumpers  $0.75 each 2 req. per gear<BR>Contact/brush assembly $27.50  $2.00 S&H<P>Each gear ordered includes 8 screws and nuts to replace the rivits you have to drill out to open the case.<P>The contact/brush assembly includes the correct pigtails with the correct connectors. <P>Rodney Dickman<BR> <A HREF="http://www.execpc.com/~rodney1/" TARGET=_blank>http://www.execpc.com/~rodney1/</A> ||||reg||4
